### 4.5 Transitional (Phases 1–4) vs final (Phase 5)
During Phases 1–4 the physical tree is still the legacy one (`docs/guides`, `docs/collections`, `docs/guides/.config`). The concern files already live at their final place `docs/.site/`, but **path-valued options keep their legacy values and legacy base** (paths relative to `docs/guides`), and `definitions` still carries `guidesPath`, `indexPath`, `project.*`; `collections[].path` still has `../collections/articles`. `layout.mjs` exposes `configBase` (= `docs/guides` until P5.4, then = tree root). Appendix C lists every value converted in Phase 5.

### 4.6 Loader contract
```js
// scripts/spmpst/config/index.mjs  (agnostic)
export function loadSiteModelSync(layout, options = {}) {
  // returns { model, targets, sources, warnings }
  //   model    : merge of concern files + `locales` (per-language bundles) + `publicFiles`
  //   targets  : { <name>: <raw parsed JSON of .site/targets/<name>.target.config.json> }  (opaque)
  //   sources  : absolute paths of every file read (dev-server watching)
  //   warnings : non-fatal findings
}
// scripts/preparation/runtime.mjs  (VitePress adapter)
export function toVitepressRuntime(model, vitepressTarget, layout) { /* section 4.3 */ }
```
Order: discover → parse JSON (errors carry file path) → ownership check → per-concern validation → one bundle per language in `lang.languages` (missing = error, extra = warning) → bundle validation → assemble model → cross-file validation (topbar `guide`/`collection` references, `seo.icon` exists, `selector` booleans) → return. Errors are collected and thrown **together** (Phase 2); Phase 1 may throw on the first.

